{"2068850": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Curvature", "steam_appid": 2068850, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068850/extras/60257f0fc91fc881df8b7f4ab3b876ce.avif?t=1786022177\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nameless machine, on a mission in a highly volatile world. A planet controlled by gruesome creatures, abusing and corrupting everything in their reach.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🧭 Handcrafted World Made With Love For Detail</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068850/extras/069cacd0f6e2f33521e34eea718bad3b.poster.avif?t=1786022177\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068850/extras/069cacd0f6e2f33521e34eea718bad3b.webm?t=1786022177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068850/extras/069cacd0f6e2f33521e34eea718bad3b.mp4?t=1786022177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If the walls could talk - designed with careful attention to lore and pacing</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An intricate web - interconnected locations, discoveries around every corner</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A living beast to tame - not a backdrop to a forgotten story</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decorations become actors - interactivity and depth for emergent gameplay</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>⚔️ A️ Dance With The Lions</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068850/extras/5e399b5df738244b884123bb9dd608b2.poster.avif?t=1786022177\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068850/extras/5e399b5df738244b884123bb9dd608b2.webm?t=1786022177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068850/extras/5e399b5df738244b884123bb9dd608b2.mp4?t=1786022177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your battles wisely - prepare before entering the cage</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fierce and insidious - read your enemies, react to the unforeseen</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weighty and grounded - friendly fire turns enemies into tools</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You choose the genre - strike, shoot, and strategize your own way</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🛠️ Earn Your Edge, Shape Your Style</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068850/extras/56fea339a8a543f749767503e31d638d.poster.avif?t=1786022177\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068850/extras/56fea339a8a543f749767503e31d638d.webm?t=1786022177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068850/extras/56fea339a8a543f749767503e31d638d.mp4?t=1786022177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every choice matters - the world is your skill tree, and resources are key</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Function over form - builds aren’t mere numbers, they define how you play</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leveling up is just fine tuning - gadgets and upgrades are the main course</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From Zero to Hero - evolve from disposable piece of steel into a forged weapon of will</strong> </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🌀 Mind Over Matter</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068850/extras/b4b34f89436f775cd1ef073933500feb.poster.avif?t=1786022177\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068850/extras/b4b34f89436f775cd1ef073933500feb.webm?t=1786022177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068850/extras/b4b34f89436f775cd1ef073933500feb.mp4?t=1786022177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One force to move them all - accelerate yourself and nearby objects using a telekinetic field</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What bullets? - deploy antikinetic waves to stop moving objects in their tracks</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Think fast, move faster - improvise deadly solutions using momentum and your surroundings</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don’t move around the problem, move the problem - solve physical puzzles on the fly</strong></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068850/extras/60257f0fc91fc881df8b7f4ab3b876ce.avif?t=1786022177\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nameless machine, on a mission in a highly